# Food Coma (CR 610.3b): if the enchantment leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the target is not exiled at all,
# but the ability still resolves and creates the Food token, since its target is still legal (CR 608.2b). Bot1 casts it on turn
# three aiming at Bot2's Ornithopter; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 destroys the enchantment with Disenchant. The
# Ornithopter stays in play and Bot1 gets the Food.

